{
    "background_story": "Kade was a class clown who often used humor to mask his own insecurities. However, his jokes and antics frequently crossed the line, making him the subject of ridicule among his peers. His classmates would mock his outlandish outfits and hairstyles, and even his teachers would occasionally chuckle at his expense. But Kade took it all in stride, using the ridicule as fuel to hone his comedic skills. He began performing stand-up comedy at local open mic nights, where his self-deprecating humor and ability to laugh at himself earned him a loyal following. As Kade's confidence grew, so did his audience. He eventually landed a spot on a popular comedy show, where he used his platform to poke fun at the absurdities of high school life and the ridicule he once endured. Kade's ability to turn ridicule into laughter and success earned him a reputation as a fearless and hilarious comedian.",
